---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Renegade Academy · Build Your Own Demand"
  description="Renegade Academy is an 8-week live marketing implementation program for mortgage professionals. Build your own customer acquisition system with live training, community, and your first year of the Renegade CRM included."
  canonical="https://gorenegades.com/academy"
  ogTitle="Renegade Academy — Marketing Renegades"
  ogDescription="Stop depending entirely on referrals, purchased leads, and random tactics. Learn to create demand and build the marketing system to support it."
>
  <div class="page">
    <Header ctaLabel="Enroll" ctaHref="https://enroll.gorenegades.com" />
 NAV 
 HERO 
<header class="hero" id="top">
<div class="hero-glow"></div>
<img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="hero-mark" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhmzbmbgv/image/upload/v1781654329/if7y7hb2iwlkmumkfz24.png"/>
<div class="wrap hero-in">
<img alt="Renegade Academy" class="hero-badge" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhmzbmbgv/image/upload/v1781654329/if7y7hb2iwlkmumkfz24.png"/>
<span class="ey">Next semester starts Sept 2, 2026 · 30 seats</span>
<h1 class="disp"><span class="l1">Renegade</span><span class="l2">Academy</span></h1>
<p class="hero-tag">Join fellow mortgage brokers and build your  <b class="u-acc">entire marketing system.</b></p>
<p class="hero-sub">Renegade Academy is an <b>8-week college-style live classroom</b> for mortgage brokers. Together, with fellow classmates, you'll build your own marketing system that generates leads, referrals, and, sets you apart from all the others in your market. <b>Your first year of the Renegade CRM (HighLevel) is not only included, but we build and learn it together to become an unstoppable machine.</b></p>
<div class="hero-cta">
<a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://enroll.gorenegades.com">Enroll in the next semester <span class="ar">→</span></a>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#semester">See what you'll build</a>
</div>
</div>
</header>
 MARQUEE 
<div aria-hidden="true" class="marquee"><div class="mq-track">
<span>Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> Believe <span class="sl">/</span> Build <span class="sl">/</span> Break Free <span class="sl">/</span> Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> Believe <span class="sl">/</span> Build <span class="sl">/</span> Break Free <span class="sl">/</span> </span><span>Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> Believe <span class="sl">/</span> Build <span class="sl">/</span> Break Free <span class="sl">/</span> Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> Believe <span class="sl">/</span> Build <span class="sl">/</span> Break Free <span class="sl">/</span> </span>
</div></div>
 SEMESTER 
<section class="sec sec-ink" id="semester">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="sem-head rv">
<div>
<span class="ey">Next semester starts Sept 2, 2026</span>
<h2 class="disp" style="margin-top:14px">Upcoming <span class="g">semester schedule.</span></h2>
</div>
<span class="badge">Wednesdays · 10:00 AM MDT · 30 seats</span>
</div>
<p class="sec-lead rv">We meet live together each week. You learn the strategies, then we build the system together as we go.</p>
<div class="wk-list rv">
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">01</div><div class="wk-phase">Sept 2 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Intro: Think Bigger. Build the Schedule. Set Up the System.</div><p class="wk-desc"><strong>Mindset:</strong> how to get your brain to think like — and believe you are — a millionaire. Build your marketing schedule, protect personal-contact time as your most important business-development block, and get your Renegade software set up so everything that follows has somewhere to live.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">02</div><div class="wk-phase">Sept 9 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Personal Branding</div><p class="wk-desc">Create one long-form video, use Descript to edit it efficiently, and turn it into one reel per day. We'll also build your Escape &amp; Arrival messaging using examples, prompts, and a working spreadsheet. <strong>RenegadeAI:</strong> use the social media planner to organize and publish across your channels.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">03</div><div class="wk-phase">Sept 16 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Email Marketing</div><p class="wk-desc">Segment your list, build automation that forces consistency, and create newsletters that people actually want to read — whether you keep them simple or use AI to sharpen the presentation. <strong>RenegadeAI:</strong> list segmentation, one-off communication, automation, templates, and newsletter building.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">04</div><div class="wk-phase">Sept 23 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Facebook &amp; Instagram Advertising</div><p class="wk-desc">Learn the ads mortgage professionals should know how to run, including lead ads designed to generate inexpensive inquiries and the follow-up video that turns a name and number into a real conversation. <strong>RenegadeAI:</strong> capture the lead data, organize it, notify you, and begin the nurture automatically.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">05</div><div class="wk-phase">Sept 30 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Lab: Q&amp;A + Build Session</div><p class="wk-desc">No new lecture deck. Bring what you're working on, what's stuck, what's confusing, and what needs to be built. We use the session to troubleshoot, answer questions, tighten campaigns, and make sure the first half of the semester is actually getting implemented.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">06</div><div class="wk-phase">Oct 7 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Event Marketing</div><p class="wk-desc">Use events to create connection, lower the social barrier, build goodwill, and leverage referral relationships. Learn how to sponsor existing events — sales meetings, CE, tours, association events — or host your own webinars, happy hours, client events, masterminds, and events outside the Realtor network. <strong>RenegadeAI:</strong> invitation and reminder sequences, plus Ninja capture and follow-up.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">07</div><div class="wk-phase">Oct 14 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Database Marketing</div><p class="wk-desc">Turn the database you already have into an active marketing asset. We'll work through follow-up, email marketing, pipeline management, direct mail, and reputation management so old opportunities and past relationships don't quietly disappear.</p></div></div>
<div class="wk-row"><div><div class="wk-n">08</div><div class="wk-phase">Oct 21 · 10:00 AM MDT</div></div><div><div class="wk-title">Referral Partners</div><p class="wk-desc">Build the kinds of partner relationships that make you the go-to mortgage professional in your market: joint content, business-building meetings, events, your own mastermind, weekly follow-up, and smart email communication that keeps the relationship alive.</p></div></div>
</div>
<p class="sem-foot rv">Eight Wednesdays. One live semester. Strategy, classmates, software, and implementation — built together.</p>
</div>
</section>
 MARQUEE 2 
<div aria-hidden="true" class="marquee gold rev"><div class="mq-track">
<span>Next Semester Sept 2 <span class="sl">/</span> Wednesdays 10 AM MDT <span class="sl">/</span> 30 Seats <span class="sl">/</span> Learn It Together <span class="sl">/</span> Build It Together <span class="sl">/</span> </span><span>Next Semester Sept 2 <span class="sl">/</span> Wednesdays 10 AM MDT <span class="sl">/</span> 30 Seats <span class="sl">/</span> Learn It Together <span class="sl">/</span> Build It Together <span class="sl">/</span> </span>
</div></div>
 STATS 
<section class="sec sec-black">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="compat rv" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:48px">
<p><strong>Already have a coach or coaching platform you like? Keep it.</strong> Renegade Academy works alongside good sales coaching, Realtor strategies, database programs, accountability, and business planning. Our lane is marketing implementation — learning the strategy and building the system together.</p>
</div>
<div class="rv" style="max-width:860px">
<span class="ey">What Renegade Academy actually is</span>
<h2 class="disp">Not just another course. <span class="g">Live classes. Built together.</span></h2>
<p class="sec-lead">Renegade Academy combines strategy, live instruction, software, fellow classmates, and the build process together in one program. Think college-style semester: a real start date, a real class, a shared schedule, and eight weeks of learning and building together.</p>
</div>
<div class="compare rv" style="margin-top:48px">
<div class="cc"><div class="ct">Learn</div><h3>Live strategy</h3><ul>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Eight Wednesday classes on a real schedule</li>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Ask questions while the strategy is being taught</li>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Learn from classmates' questions and ideas too</li>
</ul></div>
<div class="cc"><div class="ct">Build</div><h3>Implementation</h3><ul>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Put the ideas into your actual business as we go</li>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Build inside the same CRM you'll keep using</li>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Lab time to troubleshoot what you're implementing</li>
</ul></div>
<div class="cc win"><div class="ct">Belong</div><h3>Classmates + alumni</h3><ul>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Pre-class online mixer before the semester starts</li>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Ongoing alumni strategy calls and guest speakers</li>
<li><span class="mk">+</span> Live events and Renegade Nerd Nights after graduation</li>
</ul></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="hazard thin"></div>
 BUILD TOGETHER 
<section class="sec sec-ink build-grid">
<div class="narrow rv">
<span class="ey">What you'll actually build</span>
<h2 class="disp">Marketing that lives in <span class="g">your real business.</span></h2>
<p class="sec-lead">Each week adds another working piece. The goal isn't a binder full of notes — it's a marketing rhythm, a system, and assets you can keep using after the semester ends.</p>
<ul class="feat">
<li><span class="n">01</span><p><strong>Your weekly marketing schedule.</strong> A repeatable plan for personal contact, content, email, database work, advertising, events, and referral-partner activity.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">02</span><p><strong>Your personal-brand content engine.</strong> Long-form video turned into short-form content, organized and distributed with RenegadeAI.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">03</span><p><strong>Your email and database system.</strong> Segmentation, newsletters, one-off communication, automation, pipeline management, and follow-up.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">04</span><p><strong>Your lead-generation campaigns.</strong> Facebook and Instagram lead ads connected directly to capture, notification, nurture, and follow-up.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">05</span><p><strong>Your event-marketing playbook.</strong> A practical way to sponsor, host, promote, remind, capture, and follow up from events.</p></li>
<li><span class="n">06</span><p><strong>Your referral-partner operating rhythm.</strong> Joint content, meetings, events, masterminds, weekly follow-up, and communication that makes you useful instead of forgettable.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
 GOLD BAND 
<section class="band rv">
<div class="wrap">
<h2 class="disp">Your Renegade CRM turns on immediately.</h2>
<p>Your first year is included with tuition. You get our fully unlocked white-label HighLevel setup with Renegade snapshots, templates, workflows, and the tools we'll use throughout the semester — a platform that is $3,600 per year off the shelf. Log in before class starts, explore it, and come to the first session ready to build.</p>
</div>
</section>
 DARIN 
<section class="sec sec-black">
<div class="wrap darin rv">
<div class="darin-photo">
<img alt="Darin Rhodes" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhmzbmbgv/image/upload/v1779927635/qxbvr39vr04gclalfb9b.jpg"/>
<span class="tag">Darin Rhodes</span>
</div>
<div>
<span class="ey">Why I built this</span>
<h2 class="disp">Mortgage people are taught mortgages. <span class="g">They're rarely taught marketing.</span></h2>
<p>I've spent more than two decades in this industry, including years teaching and coaching mortgage professionals. I kept seeing the same gap: good originators knew how to take care of a borrower once the opportunity showed up, but many had never been taught how to systematically create that opportunity in the first place.</p>
<p>That's why Renegade Academy is built around implementation. We'll talk strategy, but then we're going to open the software, build the campaign, wire up the follow-up, look at the numbers, and make it usable in the real world. <strong>The goal is not to make you dependent on Renegade. It's to make you better at creating and managing your own demand.</strong></p>
<div class="sig">
<div><div class="nm">Darin Rhodes</div><div class="ti">Founder &amp; Head Coach</div></div>
<div class="bd">Learn it · Build it · Run it</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 INCLUDED 
<section class="sec sec-ink">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="rv" style="max-width:850px">
<span class="ey">Everything included</span>
<h2 class="disp">One tuition. <span class="g">Training. System. Community. Software. Alumni.</span></h2>
<p class="sec-lead">Enrollment includes the full eight-week semester, the Renegade CRM for your first year, the class community, implementation support, and the alumni experience after graduation.</p>
</div>
<div class="offer-grid rv">
<div class="offer-card"><div class="tagline">Live semester</div><h3>8 Wednesday classes</h3><p>Sept 2 through Oct 21 at 10:00 AM MDT. Learn the strategy and build together each week.</p></div>
<div class="offer-card"><div class="tagline">Before class</div><h3>Pre-class online mixer</h3><p>Meet the other mortgage professionals in your semester before the first class so you're not walking into week one as a room full of strangers.</p></div>
<div class="offer-card"><div class="tagline">Software</div><h3>First year of Renegade CRM</h3><p>Our fully unlocked white-label HighLevel setup, including Renegade snapshots, templates, workflows, and tools. Activated immediately after enrollment.</p></div>
<div class="offer-card"><div class="tagline">After graduation</div><h3>Renegade alumni</h3><p>Ongoing live strategy calls, guest speakers, access to live events, community, and the occasional Nerd Night when we go chase the newest shiny object together.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="price-box rv">
<div>
<span class="ey">Tuition</span>
<div style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:30px;color:var(--smoke-dim);text-decoration:line-through;margin-top:8px">$4,999</div>
<div class="price">$2,500</div>
</div>
<p><strong>One tuition covers the semester and your first year of software.</strong> The Renegade CRM alone is a $3,600/year platform off the shelf. For many mortgage professionals, $2,500 is less than the gross compensation from a single closing. If the marketing capability you build contributes to one additional closing, the tuition can pay for itself; anything beyond that is upside. No specific results are guaranteed.</p>
</div>
<div class="compat rv">
<p><strong>Seats are limited to 30 mortgage professionals per semester.</strong> That's intentional. The value of a live class drops when the room gets too big to ask questions, participate, and actually build together.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 PROCESS 
<section class="sec sec-black">
<div class="narrow rv">
<span class="ey">What happens when you enroll</span>
<h2 class="disp">You're in. <span class="g">Here's what happens next.</span></h2>
<div class="process-list">
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">01</div><div><h3>Your CRM is activated</h3><p>You get immediate access to Renegade CRM so you can log in, explore the snapshots and templates, and start getting familiar with the system before classes begin.</p></div></div>
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">02</div><div><h3>Join the Renegade community</h3><p>Get connected to the class space, schedule, resources, and the mortgage professionals you'll be learning and building beside.</p></div></div>
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">03</div><div><h3>Come to the pre-class mixer</h3><p>Meet your classmates online before Sept 2. No curriculum. No homework. Just put faces to names and start the semester with some actual relationships already forming.</p></div></div>
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">04</div><div><h3>Start Sept 2 at 10:00 AM MDT</h3><p>We meet live every Wednesday for eight weeks. Learn the strategy, ask questions, and build the next piece together.</p></div></div>
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">05</div><div><h3>Graduate into alumni</h3><p>When the semester ends, the class schedule stops. Your access to the people, strategy calls, guest speakers, events, and Nerd Nights does not.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 ALUMNI 
<section class="sec sec-ink" id="alumni">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="rv" style="max-width:820px">
<span class="ey">The Renegade alumni</span>
<h2 class="disp">The semester ends. <span class="g">Renegades keep meeting.</span></h2>
<p class="sec-lead">Graduation isn't an expiration date. Alumni stay connected for ongoing strategy, new ideas, new technology, and the kind of conversations that are more useful when everyone already speaks the same marketing language.</p>
</div>
<div class="alum-grid rv">
<div class="alum"><div class="an">01</div><h3>Live strategy calls</h3><p>Join other graduates for ongoing sessions focused on campaigns, marketing problems, numbers, ideas, and what's working now.</p></div>
<div class="alum"><div class="an">02</div><h3>Guest speakers</h3><p>Hear from marketers, operators, technology experts, and other people worth learning from when they have something useful to bring to the room.</p></div>
<div class="alum"><div class="an">03</div><h3>Live events</h3><p>Get access to Renegade live events where alumni can reconnect, learn, compare notes, and build relationships beyond a Zoom square.</p></div>
<div class="alum"><div class="an">04</div><h3>Nerd Night</h3><p>Our official shiny-object night. We throw out the regular schedule and play with the newest tech, AI tools, automations, and other cool stuff we probably shouldn't interrupt class to chase.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="hazard"></div>
