 DOWNSHIFT / FREE COMMUNITY 
<section class="sec sec-black" style="padding:70px 0">
<div class="narrow rv" style="text-align:center">
<span class="ey dim">Not ready for the semester?</span>
<h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,64px)">Join the <span class="g">Renegades.</span></h2>
<p class="sec-lead" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Join our free community for live discussion, useful marketing ideas, new tech we're testing, and the Renegade marketing newsletter delivered to your inbox.</p>
<div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content:center">
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://community.gorenegades.com">Join the Free Renegades Community</a>
</div>
