 FAQ 
<section class="sec sec-ink" id="faq">
<div class="narrow rv">
<span class="ey">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="disp">A few <span class="g">quick answers.</span></h2>
<div class="process-list">
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">01</div><div><h3>Can I keep my current coach or coaching program?</h3><p>Yes. Renegade Academy is designed to work alongside coaching, Realtor strategies, database programs, accountability, and business planning you already use.</p></div></div>
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">02</div><div><h3>Is the Renegade CRM really included?</h3><p>Yes. Your first 12 months of the Renegade CRM are included in your first-year membership and your account is activated immediately after enrollment.</p></div></div>
<div class="process-row"><div class="pn">03</div><div><h3>What continues after the eight-week semester?</h3><p>Your Renegade CRM and active-member experience continue with your subscription, including alumni strategy calls, guest speakers, live events, community access, and Nerd Night programming.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
